msgid "5.3 メモリ上の並び"
msgstr "5.3 Memory layout"

msgid "**Fortran は最初の添字が連続（列優先、column-major）、MISO の `Array3D` は最後の添字が連続（行優先、row-major）です。** 同じ `a(i, j, k)` と書いても、メモリ上で隣にある要素が違います。"
msgstr "**In Fortran, the first index is contiguous (column-major); in MISO's `Array3D`, the last index is contiguous (row-major).** Even when you write the same `a(i, j, k)`, the elements that are adjacent in memory are different."

msgid "Fortran の `a(i, j, k)`"
msgstr "Fortran `a(i, j, k)`"

msgid "MISO の `a(i, j, k)`"
msgstr "MISO `a(i, j, k)`"

msgid "メモリ上で隣の要素"
msgstr "Adjacent element in memory"

msgid "`a(i+1, j, k)`"
msgstr ""

msgid "`a(i, j, k+1)`"
msgstr ""

msgid "速く回すループ（最も内側）"
msgstr "Loop to run fast (innermost)"

msgid "`i`"
msgstr ""

msgid "`k`"
msgstr ""

msgid "要素の位置（`a(nx, ny, nz)`）"
msgstr "Element position (`a(nx, ny, nz)`)"

msgid "`i + nx*(j + ny*k)`（0 始まりに直した場合）"
msgstr "`i + nx*(j + ny*k)` (converted to 0-based)"

msgid "`(i*ny + j)*nz + k`"
msgstr ""

msgid "次の短いプログラムは、MISO の `Array3D` で要素がメモリの先頭から何番目にあるかを表示します（説明用の例）。"
msgstr "The following short program prints how far each element of a MISO `Array3D` is from the start of memory (an example for explanation)."

msgid "`k` を 1 増やすと隣（1 番目）、`j` を 1 増やすと 4 個先、`i` を 1 増やすと $3 \\times 4 = 12$ 個先です。 Fortran で同じ大きさの配列 `a(2, 3, 4)` を作ると、`a(2, 1, 1)` が先頭から 2 番目（1 始まり）になり、`i` の方向が連続します。 MISO の出力ファイル（`mhd/mhd.*.bin`）もこの並びで書かれるので、Fortran や NumPy で読むときは添字の順に注意します。"
msgstr "Increasing `k` by 1 moves to the adjacent element (1 away), increasing `j` by 1 moves 4 elements ahead, and increasing `i` by 1 moves $3 \\times 4 = 12$ elements ahead. If you create an array of the same size in Fortran, `a(2, 3, 4)`, then `a(2, 1, 1)` is the second element from the start (1-based), and the `i` direction is contiguous. MISO output files (`mhd/mhd.*.bin`) are also written in this order, so be careful about the order of the indices when you read them in Fortran or NumPy."

